y identical terms, as summarized below.","context":"12. NOTES PAYABLE","section":"Segment Information","block":329,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-091661","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-19","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001843165","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1843165/000121390026091661/ea0301268-10q_lqrhouse.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6f49ca47440819385abe2577c72415f89693fe6625b5edbb13e7d8a682b1b047.bin","sha256":"6f49ca47440819385abe2577c72415f89693fe6625b5edbb13e7d8a682b1b047"}},{"id":"395086fda1e1c95702caa2b8b468a7f41dbc0c2fa459be0c28a1a025ecbb19ea","quote":"During the three months ended June 30, 2026, the Company issued 1,619 shares of common stock pursuant to its at-the-market offering program for net proceeds of $165,999.","context":"2026 Stock Transactions","section":"Segment Information","block":344,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-091661","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-19","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001843165","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1843165/000121390026091661/ea0301268-10q_lqrhouse.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6f49ca47440819385abe2577c72415f89693fe6625b5edbb13e7d8a682b1b047.bin","sha256":"6f49ca47440819385abe2577c72415f89693fe6625b5edbb13e7d8a682b1b047"}},{"id":"0bde4819646f7e1cdd71103f7765c4b7f5cac9806d3dbdb9b52b37df1753a53f","quote":"During the six months ended June 30, 2025, the Company issued 23,611 shares of common stock pursuant to its at-the-market offering program for net proceeds of $11,559,068, of which $108,054 was received in April 2025 and recorded as a subscription receivable as of March 31, 2025. Additionally, the Company issued 2,105 shares of common stock upon the cash exercise of outstanding warrants for aggregate gross proceeds of $4,051,415. As of June 30, 2025, no warrants remained outstanding.","context":"2025 Stock Transactions","section":"Segment Information","block":346,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-091661","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-19","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001843165","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1843165/000121390026091661/ea0301268-10q_lqrhouse.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6f49ca47440819385abe2577c72415f89693fe6625b5edbb13e7d8a682b1b047.bin","sha256":"6f49ca47440819385abe2577c72415f89693fe6625b5edbb13e7d8a682b1b047"}},{"id":"da93892d47e6a3a10351bd4c6a9a5e398a582dfe540548c70dddb58263056ac1","quote":"During the six months ended June 30, 2025, the Company issued 33 shares of common stock to Avraham Ben-Tzvi in recognition of his service as a former director, valued at $5,180 per share based on the grant-date fair value of January 2, 2025, resulting in stock-based compensation expense of $172,679 recorded within general and administrative expenses in the statements of operations.","context":"During the six months ended June 30, 2025, the Company issued 23,611 shares of common stock pursuant to its at-the-market offering program for net proceeds of $11,559,068, of which $108,054 was received in April 2025 and recorded as a subscription receivable as of March 31, 2025. Additionally, the Company issued 2,105 shares of common stock upon the cash exercise of outstanding warrants for aggregate gross proceeds of $4,051,415. As of June 30, 2025, no warrants remained outstanding.","section":"Segment Information","block":347,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-091661","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-19","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001843165","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1843165/000121390026091661/ea0301268-10q_lqrhouse.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6f49ca47440819385ab